This is too late for that particular incident, but may help for the
future:

If you have uncontrolled teleportitis and want to do some shopping
without the cops being called, you may first ask the shopkeeper for the
prices of the items you want to pay, then drop that amount of gold
before picking up the merchandise. The shopkeeper sees the dropped gold
as your credit, and if you get teleported out, your bill will be covered
by the credit.

Of course, if you have teleport control, you can choose to teleport
somewhere inside the same shop, so you don't have the same problem.

